input.prompt:
Задача: Создать ~/.config/nixpkgs/home.nix с Home Manager конфигурацией

Контекст:
- Сэр переходит на Home Manager для dconf настроек
- Нужно перенести все настройки из modules/gnome.nix и kasiro-configuration.nix

Требования:
1. Создать папку ~/.config/nixpkgs/
2. Создать файл ~/.config/nixpkgs/home.nix с содержимым:

```nix
{ config, pkgs, lib, ... }: {
  # Home Manager version
  home.stateVersion = "24.05";

  # dconf настройки GNOME
  dconf = {
    enable = true;
    settings = {
      # Раскладки клавиатуры
      "org/gnome/desktop/input-sources" = {
        sources = lib.hm.gvariant.mkTuple [ "xkb" "us" ] [ "xkb" "ru" ];
        xkb-options = [ "grp:alt_shift_toggle" ];
      };

      # Переключение раскладки и рабочих столов
      "org/gnome/desktop/wm/keybindings" = {
        "switch-input-source" = [ "<Shift>Alt_L" ];
        "switch-input-source-backward" = [ "<Shift>Alt_R" ];
        # Ctrl+1..9 для рабочих столов
        "switch-to-workspace-1" = [ "<Control>1" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-2" = [ "<Control>2" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-3" = [ "<Control>3" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-4" = [ "<Control>4" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-5" = [ "<Control>5" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-6" = [ "<Control>6" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-7" = [ "<Control>7" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-8" = [ "<Control>8" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-9" = [ "<Control>9" ];
        # Ctrl+Left/Right для рабочих столов
        "switch-to-workspace-left" = [ "<Control>Left" ];
        "switch-to-workspace-right" = [ "<Control>Right" ];
      };

      # Курсор и hot corners
      "org/gnome/desktop/interface" = {
        cursor-theme = "Bibata-Modern-Ice";
        cursor-size = lib.hm.gvariant.mkInt32 24;
        enable-hot-corners = false;
      };
    };
  };

  # Пакеты для kasiro
  home.packages = with pkgs; [
    bibata-cursors
  ];
}
```

3. Сохранить файл

